From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juan Sanchez <juanesf91@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 19:55:00 -0500
Subject: arm64: dts: allwinner: t527-avaota-a1: enable USB3

Enable the combo PHY and the DWC3 controller. The board has no PCIe
slot, so the lane is permanently wired to the USB3 port.

Co-authored-by: opencode <noreply@opencode.ai>
Signed-off-by: Juan Sanchez <juanesf91@gmail.com>
---

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun55i-t527-avaota-a1.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun55i-t527-avaota-a1.dts
index ed78fe993..228a44308 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun55i-t527-avaota-a1.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun55i-t527-avaota-a1.dts
@@ -586,6 +619,14 @@ &usbphy {
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&combophy {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&dwc3 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &e906_rproc {
 	memory-region = <&rv_vdev0buffer>, <&rv_vdev0vring0>,
 			<&rv_vdev0vring1>, <&e906_dram_reserved>;
